{"sections":[{"slug":"Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch 定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理描述了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈特征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈特征</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">沿着</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧合映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧合映射</span>"}},{"Plain":" (proper map) $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的前推与自然性的差距</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">矫正项</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Todd类","text":"Todd <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有关</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">仅取决于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这个定理可视为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hirzebruch--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">版本</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑代数簇的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧合映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧合映射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $K(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或局部自由层的</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">环</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/K-理论","text":"K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">定义同态</span> $f_k\\colon K(X)\\to K(Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为态射</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出前推","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出前推</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的交错和</span>\n$$\r\nf_k(F):=\\sum (-1)^q R^q f_* F.\r\n$$\n<span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grothendieck%E2%80%93Riemann%E2%80%93Roch_theorem\" title=\"Wiki [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grothendieck%E2%80%93Riemann%E2%80%93Roch_theorem]\">Wiki</a></span> <span lang=\"zh\">叙述的定理考虑的是</span> $f_!=\\sum (-1)^i R^i f_*\\colon K_0(X)\\to K_0(Y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $K_0(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是凝聚层的有界复形的</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/周环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">周环</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推出映射</span> $f_*\\colon A(X)\\to A(Y)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong> (Grothendieck) <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $\\alpha\\in K(X)$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}(f_k\\alpha) \\operatorname{td}(T_Y) = f_*(\\operatorname{ch}(\\alpha)\\operatorname{td}(T_X)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Euler示性数","text":"Euler <span lang=\"zh\">示性数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\chi(X,F)$ <span lang=\"zh\">可用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈特征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈特征</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个点时</span>,\n$$\r\n\\chi(X,F)= \\operatorname{ch}\\Big(\\sum (-1)^q H^q(X,F)\\Big).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}